Note: kinds of things and functions that work with any kind of value.

a point has an x and a y.
a shape has a name, a corner and a size.

to find the area of a shape, give back the size of the shape times the size of the shape.
to move a point by some steps
  add the steps to the x of the point.
  add the steps to the y of the point.
that's all.

set square to a new shape with name "square", corner a new point with x 1 and y 2, and size 3.
say square.
move the corner of square by 10.
say "After moving:" and then the corner of square.
say "Area:" and then the area of square.

to find the first of some things, give back item 1 of the things.
to find the last of some things, give back the last item of the things.
say the first of (5, 6 and 7) and then the last of ("a", "b" and "c").
say the first of (2.5 and 3.5).

to mention twice someone
  say someone.
  say someone.
that's all.
mention twice "echo".
mention twice 42.
